<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The atlas, the large map (uiminimap.py AtlasWindow,
	     uiscript/atlaswindow.py): the atlas image of the current map with its
	     marks in a window frame, titled with the map's name. The NovaUI
	     minimap makes it (nui_minimap.MiniMap) while the atlas flag is on:
	     the facade nui_atlas.AtlasWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_atlas.py). The image is a nui-view: C++ renders the
	     legacy atlas (CPythonMiniMap::RenderAtlas, its marks and guild areas)
	     into a render target each frame the view shows, at the atlas image's
	     size, and the view's own label shows what lies under the pointer
	     (with the guild's mark over a guild area), so no Python runs per
	     frame. The body is the window, movable by its title row; it never
	     takes the focus, so the close button acts on mousedown. Escape closes
	     it in its legacy place in the Escape chain (nui_hud.EscapeProxy). -->
	<title>atlas</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="atlas.rcss"/>
</head>
<body id="atlas" template="nui" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui atlas" data-model="atlas">
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar atlas__titlebar">
		<handle class="nui-window__handle atlas__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="atlas__title-icon"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--map"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></span>
			<span id="atlas-title" class="nui-window__title atlas__title"><span
				data-if="title == ''">@ui.ZONE_MAP</span><span data-if="title != ''">{{ title }}</span></span>
		</handle>
		<button id="atlas-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim nui-has-tooltip atlas__close"
			data-event-mousedown="close(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
			class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim atlas__tip">@game.UI_CLOSE</span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="atlas__body">
		<div class="atlas__map">
			<nui-view id="atlas-view" name="atlas" class="atlas__view nui-interactive"/>
			<div class="atlas__grid"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
